{"id":"edf92e1f691cd322","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Computable Point","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Point","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-recursive]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-recursive\">../batch07/58-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd77d1a968b64c37\" href=\"?note=cd77d1a968b64c37\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aae13e7d5032f432\" href=\"?note=aae13e7d5032f432\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"37437e63af9f668e\" href=\"?note=37437e63af9f668e\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d,\\alpha,x\\in V\">\\(X,d,\\alpha,x\\in V\\)</span> (computable-presentation parameters and point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputablePoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputablePoint}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S\\)</span> (computable metric space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S\\)</span> (name predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S\\)</span>（总递归函数谓词，见所列依赖）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputablePoint}_S(X,d,\\alpha,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha)\\land x\\in X\\land \\exists p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(p)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha,x,p)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputablePoint}_S(X,d,\\alpha,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha)\\land x\\in X\\land \\exists p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(p)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha,x,p)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A point is computable exactly when it has a recursive name in the fixed computable presentation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space","status":"resolved","id":"cd77d1a968b64c37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space","status":"resolved","id":"aae13e7d5032f432","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"37437e63af9f668e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-recursion3-total-recursive-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,d,\\alpha,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputablePoint}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputablePoint}_S(X,d,\\alpha,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha)\\land x\\in X\\land \\exists p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3TotalRecursiveFunction}_S(p)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S(X,d,\\alpha,x,p)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1496,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point.md|58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-point]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["da0bcf2e3f060472","cd77d1a968b64c37","aae13e7d5032f432","37437e63af9f668e"]}